## Resin options

- **Water-washable (default grey)**
- **ABS-like** (for tougher prototypes)
- **Flexible (F80 type)**
- **Transparent** (on request)
- Other colours available on request

## Best for

- Miniatures and detailed models
- Smooth prototypes with fine geometry
- Precision parts that benefit from high detail

## Notes

Resin prints are ideal for detail and surface finish. If the part needs high impact strength or outdoor resistance, we’ll recommend an FDM material instead.

